  "instructions": [
    "Combine rice and water in a large saucepan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes or until the water is absorbed.",
    "In a separate pan, heat fermented jang over low heat until fragrant.",
    "Add honey, rose water, and pomegranate juice to the pan and stir until well combined.",
    "Add fresh thyme to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the rice to a serving dish and pour the sweet and spicy sauce over the top.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with additional fresh thyme leaves, if desired."
